### creating author // Author Register
POST http://localhost:4000/author-api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "gopi",
    "lastName": "more",
    "email": "gopi@gmail.com",
    "password": "author@12345",
    "profileImageUrl": "https://example.com/avatars/author.png"
}


### Author Register
POST http://localhost:4000/author-api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "test",
  "lastName": "Author",
  "email": "test.author@example.com",
  "password": "testauthor",
  "profileImageUrl": "https://example.com/avatars/author.png"
}


### authenticating author // Auhtor login
POST http://localhost:4000/common-api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "gopi@gmail.com",
    "password": "author@12345"
}


###creating  article (AUTHOR)
POST http://localhost:4000/author-api/articles
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "author":"698a90354ba0b500522dd8bc",
     "title":"javaScript",
     "category":"programming",
     "content":"content of javascript article"

}


### read the articles of a author
GET http://localhost:4000/author-api/articles/698a90354ba0b500522dd8bc


#### update article by author
PUT http://localhost:4000/author-api/articles
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "author":"698a90354ba0b500522dd8bc",
    "articleId":"698a90a64ba0b500522dd8c1",
     "title":"javaScript",
     "category":"Web Dev",
     "content":"content of javascript article"

}

### Delete article
PATCH http://localhost:4000/author-api/articles/6989750220ce5bf826ec4f7e/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "isArticleActive": true }


### Logout
GET http://localhost:4000/common-api/logout





### checking with Invalid path
GET http://localhost:4000/test

### blocking user by admin
PUT  http://localhost:4000/admin-api/block/698ab3ce70f07ce0788a022d

### unblocking user
PUT http://localhost:4000/admin-api/unblock/698ab3ce70f07ce0788a022d

### change password
PUT http://localhost:4000/common-api/change-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email":"gopi@gmail.com",
    "oldpassword":"author@123456",
    "newpassword":"newauthor@123456"
}

 